  "_note": [
    "Every asset is pinned by size and sha256 except ffmpeg, which carries",
    "`digest_from` instead: BtbN replaces the bytes behind its `latest` tag on",
    "every build, so a pin there fails within a day. Its digest is fetched from",
    "the GitHub release API at install time and the download is verified against",
    "that -- integrity and resume safety kept, reproducibility given up. See",
    "`ResolvableAsset` in src/finesub_bootstrap/models.py and",
    "docs/download-routes.md, the moving-upstream section.",
    "",
    "`version` for ffmpeg is a static label, not a build id, so an installed copy",
    "stays put instead of re-downloading daily. Bump it to push everyone onto a",
    "newer ffmpeg."
  ],
